whiptail

# === Explicitly NOT in ISO ===
# nvidia* cuda* cudnn* — post-install via first-boot.sh
# archiso — build-host only
# snap-pac-grub — AUR, snap-pac is sufficient
# downgrade — AUR, installed post-boot via yay
